WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.570
Wrap a coil of wire round an
iron bar and connect it to a

2
00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:04.510
battery.

3
00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:07.790
The bar picks up a chain
of steel paperclips.

4
00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:10.020
Disconnect the battery,
and they fall away.

5
00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:13.630
There's no permanent magnet
anywhere in this circuit.

6
00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.970
So where does the magnetism come from?

7
00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:19.010
In this mission, you'll map
the magnetic field around a

8
00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:19.880
straight wire.

9
00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:23.770
You'll see how winding the wire
into a coil called a solenoid

10
00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:26.010
gives a field shaped
like a bar magnet's,

11
00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:30.850
and how an iron core makes an
electromagnet much stronger.

12
00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:34.650
Your mission: find out where
the magnetism comes from.
